    <li><strong>C.A.S.E.</strong> – <em>Comma, Apostrophe, Semicolon, Exclamation</em>. Remember the order of “<span style="color: var(--warning);">C</span>ommand <span style="color: var(--warning);">A</span>lert <span style="color: var(--warning);">S</span>tatus <span style="color: var(--warning);">E</span>cho” to place these four marks correctly in a sentence.</li>
